      "writtenOn": "2024-11-12T18:22:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For \"quickly with the same DAB_SID_EXT, and DAB_FREQUENCY and DAB_ENSEMBLE as 0 first\", I don\u0027t think it is a desirable implementation. It compromises with API documentation by injecting invalid values into Android framework.\n\nI think this CL is more about DAB-DAB linking case. My concern is why `DAB_SID_EXT` can keep the same if the tuner is tuned to a linking station. For that linked station, why it contains the same `DAB_SID_EXT`? Probably it is worthwhile to file a feature request to clearly specify the behavior of program selector and info in DAB-DAB linking cases.",
